%% agent-core 一次 Turn 的控制流、取消传播与错误边界
flowchart TD
    Input[TurnInput<br/>消息、步数与取消信号] --> Run[runTurn<br/>Turn 编排器]
    Signal[CancellationSignal] --> Guard{Guard 检查}
    Run --> Guard

    Guard -->|已取消| Cancel[TurnResult<br/>cancelled]
    Guard -->|超过步数| Limit[TurnResult<br/>failed / step_limit_exceeded]
    Guard -->|允许继续| Context[TurnContext<br/>维护消息历史]

    Context --> Model[ModelAdapter<br/>FakeModel / OpenRouterModel]
    Signal -.->|传递 signal| Model
    Model --> Provider[OpenRouter fetch<br/>或 FakeModel]
    Provider --> Parse{响应协议有效?}
    Parse -->|否| ModelError[ModelExecutionError<br/>错误码与 retryable]
    Parse -->|是| Response{ModelResponse 类型}

    ModelError --> Retry{retryable?}
    Retry -->|是| FailedRetry[TurnResult failed<br/>允许 Runtime 决定重试]
    Retry -->|否| FailedStop[TurnResult failed<br/>不可重试]

    Response -->|最终文本| Done[追加 assistant 消息<br/>返回 done]
    Response -->|状态| Status[返回 waiting / blocked /<br/>needs_clarification]
    Response -->|工具调用| Assistant[追加 assistant tool_calls]

    Assistant --> ToolGuard{工具执行前<br/>再次检查取消}
    ToolGuard -->|已取消| Cancel
    ToolGuard -->|继续| Registry[ToolRegistry<br/>名称检查 + 强制 validator]
    Registry --> Executor[ToolExecutor<br/>JSON 解析 → validate → execute]
    Signal -.->|传递 signal| Executor
    Executor --> ToolResult{ToolResult}
    ToolResult -->|cancelled| Cancel
    ToolResult -->|成功或结构化错误| Context

    Done --> Output[TurnResult + TurnEvent 列表]
    Status --> Output
    Cancel --> Output
    Limit --> Output
    FailedRetry --> Output
    FailedStop --> Output

    %% Policy 不属于 agent-core，未来由 Runtime 或 Policy 层包裹工具边界
    Policy[未来 Policy<br/>允许 / 拒绝 / 需要审批] -.-> Executor
